        "properties": {
            "description": "A 50 Ohm microstrip on 100 um of alumina with an open stub at its middle, full wave at 10 GHz: the Optimization sets the stub's length Ls for the notch - |S21| at its least - at 10 GHz. The closed form, a quarter of a guided wavelength less the line's half width and the open end's extension, gives 2.85 mm; this model's mesh finds about 2.96 mm, |S21| 0.04 there. Run it from RF 2.5D > Run Optimization; Apply Optimum writes Ls in."
        },
